1
00:00:00,055 --> 00:00:02,142
Tahun 1896,

2
00:00:02,142 --> 00:00:04,220
Raja Siam mengunjungi Borobudur...

3
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:06,861
lalu pulang membawa delapan gerobak arca!

4
00:00:06,861 --> 00:00:07,895
Arca Buddha,

5
00:00:07,895 --> 00:00:08,957
singa penjaga,

6
00:00:08,957 --> 00:00:09,538
relief,

7
00:00:09,538 --> 00:00:11,265
semuanya diizinkan Belanda.

8
00:00:11,265 --> 00:00:12,053
Di Singosari,

9
00:00:12,053 --> 00:00:12,595
Malang,

10
00:00:12,595 --> 00:00:14,294
dia cuma mampir setengah jam...

11
00:00:14,294 --> 00:00:15,863
dan minta arca Ganesha.

12
00:00:15,863 --> 00:00:16,925
Dikabulkan!

13
00:00:16,925 --> 00:00:19,908
Sebagian kini dipajang di
Museum Nasional Bangkok,

14
00:00:19,908 --> 00:00:20,591
Thailand.

15
00:00:20,591 --> 00:00:22,909
Dan patung gajah di depan Museum Gajah,

16
00:00:22,909 --> 00:00:23,693
Jakarta?

17
00:00:23,693 --> 00:00:25,476
Hadiah dari raja yang sama!

18
00:00:25,476 --> 00:00:27,018
Hadiah persahabatan,

19
00:00:27,018 --> 00:00:28,440
atau kekeliruan besar?

20
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,900
Tulis di komentar!
